# Aiming the special weapons, which the developers' P key hands out in the
# first Allied mission: the Chronosphere takes a jeep and then a place to put
# it, the down key scrolls the sidebar to the Iron Curtain, and that takes
# another jeep.
# args: -PLAYTEST
at 301 click 320 231
at 341 key RETURN
at 401 click 260 228
at 500 key P
at 540 shot weapons_granted
at 541 click 603 300
at 571 click 216 150
at 601 click 250 210
at 610 shot chronoshifted
at 700 shot colors_back
at 701 key DOWN
at 705 key DOWN
at 709 key DOWN
at 740 shot sidebar_scrolled
at 741 click 603 300
at 771 click 264 150
at 800 shot iron_curtain
at 801 key UP
at 805 key UP
at 809 key UP
at 840 shot sidebar_scrolled_back
at 841 quit
